                        "entry_id": "86bb05c3-7ee9-39ea-bd4d-379807cabc36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The call to prayer, which consisted originally of simply four takbirs followed by the statement (أَشْهَدُ أَنْ) لَا إِلٰهَ إِلَّا ٱلله ((ʔašhadu ʔan) lā ʔilāha ʔillā llāh)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4580befc-37e8-4c89-8105-2b1dd39cacc9",
                                "sense_id": "38a27690-49d8-3ef7-85c9-91094e936fca",
                                "text": "If one were to pray alone, then no adhan is needed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
